Third-party dependencies
------------------------
Wearsic depends on third-party open-source libraries and tools. Those
components remain under their respective licenses; this NOTICE file does
not replace or modify any third-party license terms.

The Wear OS application uses libraries including AndroidX, Jetpack Compose,
Kotlin, Kotlin Coroutines, Kotlin Serialization, Media3/ExoPlayer, OkHttp,
Coil, Room and Roborazzi. The server additionally uses Ktor, SQLite JDBC
and Logback.

